    {
      "id": "at-glance",
      "title": "At a glance",
      "body": "Use Nói chậm chút được không? when Vietnamese is coming too quickly and repeating the same speed will not help. It keeps the exchange cooperative while asking for a slower second pass.",
      "presentation": "plain-text",
      "phrases": [],
      "breakdown": []
    },
    {
      "id": "breakdown",
      "title": "Break it down",
      "body": "Listen for Nói first, then let không? carry the question ending.",
